    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team and vibe in this PSX-inspired dungeon crawler. First, customize your team's loadout, then see your strategy play out in real-time auto battles while you clear the grid-based map in first person. Experiment with different classes, unlock shortcuts on each floor, and reach the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.poster.avif?t=1749549989\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.webm?t=1749549989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.mp4?t=1749549989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 characters from a variety of classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respec and experiment with class builds any time you return to town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school dungeon crawling with grid-based movement in first person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto battle in real-time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded whenever you map out 100% of a floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your party and upgrade your gear</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team and vibe in this PSX-inspired dungeon crawler. First, customize your team's loadout, then see your strategy play out in real-time auto battles while you clear the grid-based map in first person. Experiment with different classes, unlock shortcuts on each floor, and reach the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.poster.avif?t=1749549989\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.webm?t=1749549989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730420/extras/03cdb07edce03acf9de9b0d97beb859b.mp4?t=1749549989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose 4 characters from a variety of classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respec and experiment with class builds any time you return to town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school dungeon crawling with grid-based movement in first person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto battle in real-time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded whenever you map out 100% of a floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your party and upgrade your gear</p></li></ul>",
